service account key file,

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.960
and obtain an
authorization token

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.520
using the service account.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:27.070
We can then use the curl
command to inspect the JSON

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.690
