00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.940
And the response shows that
the phone number was found

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.560
with a likelihood of likely.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.170
We can also redact
sensitive information.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.570
We create a second
JSON file, this time

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.000
with a sensitive email address.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.940
We can then use the curl
command to deidentify the JSON

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.017
file for sensitive information.

00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:46.600
We can see the
response that the email

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.400
